kinVideo/50001/3098/309803/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3098/309803/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3098/309803/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3098/309803/redpandacompress_大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3098/309803/redpandacompress_大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3098/309803/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3098/309803/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">一个书生赴京赶考，恐路长途远，易生波折，于是雇了一个老仆随行照应。<br />主仆二人行至深山，忽逢电光裂空，雷雨大作。书生望见远处有一荒废庙宇，想要入内暂避。<br />老仆极力劝阻，盖因此庙宇向来有邪祟传闻。乡人都称它为“玉瓶娘娘庙”，祠中神像手持宝瓶，最喜戏弄人。凡是入庙避雨的人，必遭惊扰，轻则受到惊吓，重则失了魂魄。<br />书生嗤笑一声，不以为意，径自推门而入。<br />翌日拂晓，老仆入庙宇寻找书生，只见行囊散落一地，人已是杳然无踪。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"309803\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a4/Belonging-309804.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">莲花宝冠<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Lotus Crown</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />150<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>发髻如云，簪戴莲花，令人心生敬拜，但盘绕的银蛇让每个试图攀谈的人都踌躇再三。<br />问及莲花座里为何有蛇化生，受访者盈盈一笑：“嘘，别声张，您本不该看得见它。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309806.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/cd/Belonging-309806.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">古银腰坠<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Silver Waist Charm</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />188<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>玉石与银珠交纵错杂，织成一面蛛网，随步伐、随清风摇荡。它为每一位信徒收罗凡尘爱恨，也收罗他们一瞬的悚然和惊惧。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309805.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b0/Belonging-309805.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">贪、嗔、痴<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">The Three Poisons</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>通体翠绿的净瓶，杨柳生机盎然，露滴甜如蜜糖。“何必在意那表象的细枝末节？眼下只需品尝这甘甜的欢愉。”受访者柔声劝说：“来吧，别怕，它是个乖孩子。”</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Tupo xindiantu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/107px-Tupo_xindiantu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/161px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/214px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"740\" data-file-height=\"208\" /></td><th>EN</th><th>中</th><th class=\"not-zh\">日</th><th class=\"not-zh\">한</th><th>文本</th></tr><tr><th>入队</th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero309803_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero309803_fightingvoc_55\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc\">中 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero309803_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero309803_fightingvoc_55\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span 